{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1795468679,"nonce":"wp+/iB+Ad7O9QdYgUPzf9Ktf9rg=","message":"Relayout boundaries, 6dc56707 (local, not pushed).\n\nLayoutTree now stores its own nodes and implements taffy's tree traits. Each node logs the queries its parent asked (input and output, up to 24 distinct; a query carrying block float state makes the node unreplayable). After an edit the changed nodes settle bottom-up: a node is asked its logged queries again; if every answer matches (measures by size and margin state, layouts by size, baselines, margins, and scrollable overflow only on axes where it propagates per taffy's compute_scrollable_overflow_contribution), the parent is untouched and only that subtree is rounded. Otherwise the parent is asked in turn. A style change also marks the parent, which reads child styles.\n\nInstructions for the 200-turn headless run (same env as before, /usr/bin/time -l, interleaved): HEAD 32008e10 about 47.35e9, 6dc56707 about 44.97e9 (5.0%). With BLINC_LAYOUT_BOUNDARIES=0 the new storage alone is about 46.3e9: dropping the two id maps (every children walk went through reverse_map) is about 2%, boundaries about 3%.\n\nA month turn now stops at the months row (node with the pages), rounding 170 to 560 nodes of about 3,500. Every replay there answers the same. The first attempt capped the log at 12 queries and the row and its parent overflowed it (a grid item gets 12 measures and a layout), so the climb reached the calendar card; the cap is 24 now.\n\nWhat is left of layout: the replay of the row is about 130 to 360 us per insert, which is the new month's grid and text laid out under the row's 13 queries, the same work a full layout does for that subtree. RenderTree::compute_layout is 198 of 4204 samples in the profile (was 248 of 4719).\n\nCorrectness: BLINC_LAYOUT_CHECK=1 lays out from scratch after each layout and panics on any difference. With it on: workspace nextest (2951 tests), blinc_app --run-ignored all (428), blinc_recorder headless --run-ignored all (385), 40 calendar turns, and 11 new unit tests in tree::relayout_tests all pass.","files":null}]}